{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18120","headline":"翫月喜张十八员外以王六秘书至 · 韩愈","name":"翫月喜张十八员外以王六秘书至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前夕虽十五，月长未满规。\n君来晤我时，风露渺无涯。\n浮云散白石，天宇开青池。\n孤质不自惮，中天爲君施。\n翫翫夜遂久，亭亭曙将披。\n况当今夕圆，又以嘉客随。\n惜无酒食乐，但用歌嘲爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}